            "heading": "The east end of Westminster Abbey",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Explore the east end of Westminster Abbey after hours. Delve into the rich history and captivating stories of the nation’s coronation church as you take in its stunning surroundings. In a self-guided visit, pop into Poets’ Corner, discover famous and less-well known memorials and gaze up at the ornate Lady Chapel ceiling."
            ]
